+# Corpus Fetching
+
+## Rate limit
+
+Per-domain: 12 visits per 60 s window. On breach, a 900 s cooldown is enforced
+before further requests to that domain resume.
+
+(Source: Svipall fetch tool, as observed in this project's own session
+history.)
+
+## CDN / mirror hosts used
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/owner/repo@branch/path`
+- `cdn.statically.io` (observed slow / prone to timeouts)
+
+Fetched output landed flat in `~/.svipall/out/`.
